venv = virtual environment.
C’est un environnement Python isolé pour ton projet. Il contient sa propre version de pip et ses propres librairies installées.

python3 -m venv .venv
Python crée un dossier .venv/ avec cet environnement.

source .venv/bin/activate
active cet environnement. À partir de là, si tu fais :

pip install numpy
numpy est installé dans ce projet, pas globalement sur ton ordinateur.

--------------------

linear regression:

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3dhcmeOTZ_Q&list=PLpFdrKzTyc_BzAfi81vNvT8Xc-vAmnR07

theta0 = pente de la ligne.  slope of the line
theta1 = ordonnée à l'origine de la droite, intercept of the line or biais in machine learning

diffences between the point and the line : squared errors (see the pic)

if we total the areas of all these squares we will get the sum of the square error and this is the loss function

we should find the theta0 and theta1 coefficient that will minimize that sum of squared errors

here this is gradient descent

2/3 data to train
1/3 to test

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ltXSoduiVwY
theta0 weights
theta1 bias

gradient descent is for optimisation


steps:
predict result by using y = wx + b
calculate error
use gradient descent to figure out new weight and bias values
repeat n times

testing:
put the values from the data point ito the equation y = wx + b


Babak:
So in the first formula the 1/m sum .... Is calculating on average how accurate predictprice is guessing the price
If the sum ... Is zero, then predictprice is guessing all the prices right
So the difference is a measure on how bad your predictor is
So i suppose tmptheta1 is used to correct predictmodel such that next time it predicts the price better, which means the sum... Is closer to zero
The learningrate is just a value that you can choose to decide how much you want modify predictprice, if learningrate is zero, then you dont change at all

theta0 is for weight (slope of the line) and theta1 is intercept of the line or biais(the height)
Yeah ok, then temptheta1 and temptheta2 is how much you are going to change theta1 and theta2 such that next time make the sum .... Be closer to zero
You do this again and again until the sum ... Cannot be closer to zero
